<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;Calls made using &amp;amp; are never inlined. ... I can't understand to what cases it applies to though.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this case, this would require one to edit [mod://AnyEvent::DNS] and change [https://metacpan.org/release/MLEHMANN/AnyEvent-7.17/source/lib/AnyEvent/DNS.pm#L1292|lines such as] &lt;c&gt;my $sa = AnyEvent::Socket::pack_sockaddr (DOMAIN_PORT, $server);&lt;/c&gt; to &lt;c&gt;my $sa = AnyEvent::Socket::pack_sockaddr (&amp;DOMAIN_PORT(), $server);&lt;/c&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
